    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I just looked over the report for the NexaCorp audit. Honestly, their setup looks really solid—almost too good. Our team didn't even find any major cracks. I'm a bit worried about how to pitch the 'Advanced Continuous Monitoring' upgrade to them this quarter if they feel like they've already got everything covered. How should we frame these results to make sure they see the value in signing the new contract?",
